WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.509 --> 00:00:13.916
Hank Tank rolled toward Roxy.

2
00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:20.340
Whiz-hoo! She fired her eye laser beams at one of his rubber treads.

3
00:00:21.261 --> 00:00:22.842
Boom! The tread exploded.

4
00:00:26.504 --> 00:00:27.565
Roxy jumped to her feet.

5
00:00:28.566 --> 00:00:29.546
Hank tried to roll.

6
00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:32.068
But the tread was broken, and he couldn't move.

7
00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:34.841
Smoke poured out from under him.

8
00:00:34.861 --> 00:00:37.363
"Human mode!"

9
00:00:37.684 --> 00:00:38.264
shouted Hank.

10
00:00:40.926 --> 00:00:42.047
Parts shifted and moved.

11
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:45.730
Hank stood up again.

12
00:00:51.255 --> 00:00:52.316
He glared at Roxy.

13
00:00:52.336 --> 00:00:56.139
"You'll regret breaking my tank, Rocket Girl!"

14
00:00:57.380 --> 00:00:58.501
Hank Tank charged.

15
00:00:59.141 --> 00:01:00.342
He slammed into Roxy.

16
00:01:01.624 --> 00:01:03.669
Bam! They knocked over a bus.

17
00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:06.531
"Ahh!" cried the bus driver.

18
00:01:06.551 --> 00:01:08.933
"Sorry!" said Roxy.

19
00:01:09.533 --> 00:01:11.514
She quickly put the bus back on its wheels.

20
00:01:13.516 --> 00:01:15.157
Hank slammed into Roxy again.

21
00:01:15.898 --> 00:01:18.339
Bam! The bus fell over again.

22
00:01:18.359 --> 00:01:21.922
"Ahh!" cried the bus driver again.

23
00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:25.124
Roxy jumped to her feet and punched.

24
00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:28.246
Crack! Hank Tank flew backward.

25
00:01:28.266 --> 00:01:30.608
"Oof!" cried Hank.

26
00:01:31.328 --> 00:01:32.688
He crashed through a store window.

27
00:01:33.929 --> 00:01:35.329
Roxy set the bus back up.

28
00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:39.770
Then she saw Hank charging toward her again.

29
00:01:41.451 --> 00:01:42.411
Roxy made a fist.

30
00:01:43.251 --> 00:01:45.212
As Hank slammed into her, she punched.

31
00:01:45.952 --> 00:01:47.653
Roxy and Hank both flew backward.

32
00:01:48.713 --> 00:01:50.413
Again Roxy slammed into the bus.

33
00:01:50.433 --> 00:01:54.414
"Ahh!" cried the bus driver.

34
00:01:54.435 --> 00:01:57.055
"Ugh!" thought Roxy.

35
00:01:57.555 --> 00:01:59.516
"How am I going to stop Hank Tank?"

36
00:02:00.356 --> 00:02:03.457
As Roxy tried to get up, Hank's big foot came down.

37
00:02:03.477 --> 00:02:07.599
"I'm going to squash you, Rocket Girl!"

38
00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:11.321
Hank laughed.

39
00:02:12.301 --> 00:02:13.561
Roxy rolled out of the way.

40
00:02:14.442 --> 00:02:17.243
Stomp! Hank's foot cracked the pavement.

41
00:02:18.403 --> 00:02:20.384
Roxy noticed Hank's large round shell.

42
00:02:20.404 --> 00:02:24.466
"I have an idea," she thought.

43
00:02:25.426 --> 00:02:26.687
Hank's foot came down again.

44
00:02:27.687 --> 00:02:29.468
Roxy grabbed the foot and flung it up.

45
00:02:30.392 --> 00:02:33.073
Hank fell backward, landing on his round shell.

46
00:02:33.873 --> 00:02:35.353
Hank waved his arms and legs.

47
00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:38.934
But he was stuck lying on his back, like a turtle.

48
00:02:38.954 --> 00:02:42.915
"Help!" cried the villain.

49
00:02:43.336 --> 00:02:44.596
"I can't get up!"

50
00:02:45.756 --> 00:02:48.237
Detective Smith arrived with some other police officers.

51
00:02:49.957 --> 00:02:50.758
Roxy smiled.

52
00:02:50.778 --> 00:02:53.918
"You can take Hank to jail, Detective!"

53
00:02:57.079 --> 00:02:59.620
The next day Roxy and her friends were in the school garden again.

54
00:03:01.984 --> 00:03:03.425
Mr. Green handed out gloves.

55
00:03:03.445 --> 00:03:06.406
"Hey, look!"

56
00:03:06.706 --> 00:03:07.246
said Mara.

57
00:03:08.027 --> 00:03:09.907
She pointed at the opposite side of the garden.

58
00:03:09.927 --> 00:03:11.588
"It's a pond!"

59
00:03:11.608 --> 00:03:14.269
"Cool!" said Jack.

60
00:03:14.289 --> 00:03:18.811
"It looks like a big turtle shell."

61
00:03:19.752 --> 00:03:20.632
Mr. Green chuckled.

62
00:03:20.652 --> 00:03:24.554
"That shell was part of a bad guy's armor.

63
00:03:25.294 --> 00:03:26.975
He robbed a bank yesterday.

64
00:03:28.015 --> 00:03:29.936
Luckily, Rocket Girl caught him.

65
00:03:30.856 --> 00:03:32.657
She gave the shell to the school."

66
00:03:35.338 --> 00:03:36.119
Terrell grinned.

67
00:03:36.139 --> 00:03:37.279
"See, Roxy?

68
00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:41.101
I knew Rocket Girl could get us a pond!"

69
00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:43.642
Roxy didn't say anything.

70
00:03:44.583 --> 00:03:46.704
She just put on her gloves and started to dig.
